@startuml
[*] --> AlertSettingsSetup
AlertSettingsSetup --> AlertConfigurationCompleted : Configure Alert Settings
AlertConfigurationCompleted --> AlertMonitoringState : Enter Monitoring
AlertMonitoringState --> AlertTriggered : Event Occurs
AlertTriggered --> AlertMonitoringState : Alert Displayed
AlertMonitoringState --> AlertSettingsModification : Modify Settings
AlertSettingsModification --> AlertConfigurationCompleted : Update Settings
AlertConfigurationCompleted --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
